    "Name": "Gerrida",
    "Details": "The Gerrida is a Society super-heavy hovertank designed as a fast skirmisher capable of identifying and overwhelming weak points in enemy formations. Its distinctive radial layout, articulated hover pads, and flotation hull allow it to operate effectively across difficult terrain and water, while an XXL engine provides exceptional mobility for a vehicle of its size. Designed with vehicular jump jets in mind, the Gerrida combines unusual maneuverability with heavy protection, though its advanced construction limits deployment primarily to elite Society vehicle crews.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Lamellor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       225     70\n<b>Left</b>         180     70\n<b>Right</b>       180     70\n<b>Rear</b>        150     70\n<b>Turret</b>      200     70\n\n<b>Total</b>      935    350</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Distracting</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Gerrida"
  },
  "YangsThoughts": "This one’s all about picking the right missile for the job. The iATMs can harass targets from way out or switch loads and absolutely tear them apart once the Gerrida closes the distance. With this thing’s speed, getting into the right range shouldn’t be much of a problem.",
